  "note": "The native transport counts the SDK's fixed 1 DEM gas with a send's signed network, rpc and additional fees when it compares them with the host fee ceiling at confirmation, broadcast and recovery resend, as the purchase service's fee read does. Before, a send whose fees equalled the ceiling and whose gas put it one DEM over was confirmed and broadcast. The amount the send pays is still not counted."
